attribution: Words by A. B. "Banjo" Paterson (1864-1941), written in 1895; tune by Christina Macpherson (1864-1936), adapted from the Scottish "Craigielee" (the familiar Marie Cowan arrangement, 1903). All authors died more than 70 years ago; public domain.
